Coordinates are plan.md's (x 0..15 W→E, z 0 street/N → 49, y 0 = street). Part numbers: P1 shell, P2 front massing, P3 roofs & cornice, P4 openings & window dressing, P5 ornament, P6 site. Vocab names are defined in plan.md VOCABULARY. Colour roles: BODY cyan_terracotta, TRIM smooth_quartz, PLUM purple_terracotta / crimson_*, GOLD yellow_terracotta + orange_terracotta, STONE stone_bricks, IRON iron_bars.

- [ ] **1 Tall narrow three-storey front over a garage base**: body 16 wide, y0..17 (+bay y4..16). Garage plinth stone y0..3 under three painted storeys (y4..16), parapet y18. Real construction: stone_bricks plinth, `siding` walls on z=7 x0..9 / x15, bay walls y4..16. P1 (z=7 wall, party walls, slabs y0/4/9/13/17), P2 (plinth+bay). Vocab: `rusticated`, `siding`.
- [ ] **2 Garage door and drive**: opening x3..6 y1..3 z4. Plum panelled door: crimson_planks fill with `crimson_trapdoor` closed (half=bottom, facing south) as raised panels at (3,1..3)...(6,1..3) in a 2×3 pattern, framed by a cream lintel `smooth_quartz_slab` row at (3..6,4,3) and ledge. Drive apron light_gray_concrete x3..6 z0..3 y0. P4 (door), P6 (apron). Vocab: `garageDoor`.
- [ ] **3 Stair of steps up to the entry (stoop)**: stair blocks `stone_brick_stairs` facing south at (11..13,1,2),(11..13,2,3),(11..13,3,4),(11..13,4,5); landing stone_bricks (11..13,4,6); stone_bricks filling under each tread to y0; cheeks stone_bricks x10/x14 (y1..4 stepping with the treads); iron_bars handrail on each cheek top. P2. Vocab: `stoop`.
- [ ] **4 Recessed entry porch with columns**: floor y4 (stand y5) x10..14 z7..9 stone_bricks, ceiling y9 plum coffer (crimson_planks with `crimson_trapdoor` inset), void y5..8; two columns at (10,5..8,7),(14,5..8,7); BODY side walls x=9, x=15 with cream wainscot (`smooth_quartz_slab` bottom y5 rows). Front wall z=7 omitted x10..14 y5..8. P2 (floor, ceiling, walls), P5 (columns). Vocab: `column`, `porchWainscot`.
- [ ] **5 Columns**: base `smooth_quartz_slab` type=bottom at y5; shaft `quartz_pillar` axis=y at y6..7; capital `smooth_quartz_stairs` half=top facing=south (lip outward) at y8; at (10,·,7) and (14,·,7). P5. Vocab: `column`.
- [ ] **6 Entry door + transom**: back wall z=10 x11..12 y5..7: `crimson_door` (two doors side by side, hinges outward, facing north) with hung `glass_pane` transom at (11..12,8,10); casing smooth_quartz stairs/slabs both sides; lantern hanging in porch at (12,8,8) (`lantern` hanging=true). P4. Vocab: `entryDoor`.
- [ ] **7 Full-height angled bay stacked up the front**: rows z4 x3..6 face; diagonals (2,5),(7,5),(1,6),(8,6); y4..16; bay floors at y4 (plinth top), y9, y13 over x3..6 z5, x2..7 z6; lid y17 over the bay rows. Walls `siding`; spandrels at y9 (`spandrel`, purple_terracotta) and y13 (`fishscale`). Cream corner boards (`quartz_pillar` axis=y) replace the wall block at (3,4),(6,4),(2,5),(7,5),(1,6),(8,6) y4..16. P2. Vocab: `bayWall`, `cornerBoard`.
- [ ] **8 Tall narrow double-hung windows with ornate pediments and trim**: every window in plan.md OPENINGS; glass_pane fill, plum `crimson_trapdoor` open=true shutters-as-casing NOT used; casing = smooth_quartz_stairs/blocks; sill `smooth_quartz_slab` +1 at y4/9/13; pediment hood: pair = two `crimson_stairs` (facing east at left cell, west at right) + `smooth_quartz_slab` bottom caps at one cell above the head (y8,13,16); singles = `smooth_quartz_slab`. P4. Vocab: `window`, `hoodPair`, `hoodSingle`, `sill`.
- [ ] **9 Elaborate bracketed cornice**: y17 `smooth_quartz_stairs` half=top facing into wall at z=6 x0,9..15 and the bay ring (z=3 x2..7; (1,4),(8,4),(0,5),(9,5)); lid beneath; paired plum `crimson_stairs` half=top brackets at y16 below it; plum dentils `crimson_trapdoor` half=top closed at y16 between brackets. Returns 1 cell on the party walls at z=7..8 y16..17. P3 (cornice course), P5 (brackets, dentils). Vocab: `cornice`, `bracket`, `dentils`.
- [ ] **10 False-front parapet with centre pediment**: y18 z=7 x0..15 `siding` (BODY), coping `smooth_quartz_slab` bottom y19 at z=6..7 x1..5,10..14; pediment (6..9,19,7): x6 `smooth_quartz_stairs` facing east, x7..8 yellow_terracotta, x9 stairs facing west; crown `smooth_quartz_slab` at (7..8,20,7). Ball finials at (0,19,7),(15,19,7): `smooth_quartz` + `end_rod` above. P3. Vocab: `parapet`, `pediment`, `finial`.
- [ ] **11 Fish-scale shingles + horizontal siding**: siding is the wall block everywhere; fish scale: `fishscale` panel (yellow_terracotta/orange_terracotta staggered, 2 rows) on y13 spandrel of bay faces/diagonals, y16 frieze between brackets across z=7 x0..15 and bay faces z=4,diagonals, and in the pediment tympanum. P2 (y13 band), P5 (y16 frieze).
- [ ] **12 Painted-lady colours (≥3 body+trim)**: BODY teal cyan_terracotta, TRIM white smooth_quartz, PLUM purple_terracotta/crimson, GOLD yellow+orange terracotta, grey stone, black iron. All parts.
- [ ] **13 Tiny front garden behind an iron fence**: beds at plan SITE (soil `dirt`/`coarse_dirt` at y0, flowers y1: red_tulip, poppy, allium, azure_bluet, lilac, flowering_azalea shrub), `ironFence` along z=2: stone_bricks curb y0 + iron_bars y1 (+ `stone_brick_wall` posts every 3rd at y1), gaps x3..6 and x11..13; cheek wins at x10,x14. P6. Vocab: `ironFence`, `flowerBed`.
- [x] **14 Party walls close on both sides**: x=0 and x=15, z7..30, y0..18, `bricks`, blank (neighbours are implied by the blank brick). P1.
- [ ] **15 Deep back garden with deck**: deck posts (spruce_fence) at plan cells y3 (up to deck), deck `spruce_planks` top y4 x1..14 z31..35, joist `spruce_stairs`/`spruce_slab` fascia, railing `spruce_fence` y5 on z=35 (gap x6..8) and x1/x14 sides, step `spruce_stairs` at (6..8,3,36) facing south ascending north; lawn `grass_block` to y2, gravel path x7..8, retaining step `stone_brick_slab` y3 z44, upper garden y3. P6. Vocab: `deck`, `gardenBed`.
- [ ] **16 Tree**: trunk `oak_log` (12,3..7,41) (grade there y2, so trunk from y3), canopy `oak_leaves` persistent=true sphere r=3 centre (12,9,41) (y7..10 per plan). P6. Vocab: `tree`.
- [ ] **17 Raised vegetable beds, side flower beds, fences**: beds `farmland` with `spruce_slab`-free rim of `spruce_planks` (y3, soil y4 per plan), side borders `coarse_dirt` + flowers; board fences `spruce_fence` 2 high at x=0, x=15 (z31..49) and z=49. P6. Vocab: `gardenBed`.
- [ ] **18 Chimney**: `bricks` stack x0..2 z12..13 y18..19, cap `stone_brick_slab` at y20, two `brick_wall` flue pots on the cap at (1,21,12),(1,21,13). P3. Vocab: `chimney`.
- [ ] **19 Skylight**: opening x6..9 z15..17 y17 left by P3; glazed with `glass` by P4; curb of `smooth_quartz_slab` type=bottom at y18 around it. Vocab: `skylight`.
- [ ] **20 Rear façade**: BODY siding, stone base y0..3, windows per OPENINGS with flat cream hoods, French doors, 1-proud cornice y17 z=31, parapet y18 z=30. P1 (wall), P4 (glazing), P3 (cornice/parapet).
- [ ] **21 Rusticated stone plinth + water table**: `rusticated`, trim string y3 proud (z=3) and ledge slabs y4. P2.
- [ ] **22 Exterior lights**: `lantern` hanging=true at (12,8,8) in the porch ceiling; `lantern` standing on the cheek tops at (10,5,6) and (14,5,6). P5.
- [ ] **23 Interior (rooms)**: entry hall + long stair along E party wall (x13..14 z11..16), parlour behind bay with fireplace x=1 z11..13, dining, kitchen to garden, upstairs bedrooms front/back, bathroom clawfoot tub, top-floor room under the roof with skylight. Built by the rooms' designers; P1 builds the shells, partitions, slabs, stairs.
- [ ] **24 Stair runs**: garage→main (13..14, y=z-25, z26..29), main→2 (13..14, y=5+(z-12), z12..16), 2→3 (13..14, y=10+(z-19), z19..22), `*_stairs` facing south bottom; slab holes as per RESERVED. P1 builds the holes, the rooms' designers the stairs.

